      <publication_year>2021</publication_year>
      <description>Numerical shape model of asteroid 951 Gaspra, constructed from Galileo images of
Gaspra taken October 29, 1991, using stereogrammetry and limb matching techniques. 
For further information see Thomas et al. 1994, Icarus 107, 25.  This shape model
consists of a grid with points every 2 degrees in latitude and longitude, with a
radius in km associated with each point.  Coordinates are planetocentric.</description>
